 "description": "<p>The fairytale costume in velvet: a full set including the shawl, in red, one size for 40-60 kg. The shawl is the piece that carries the character - without it, red velvet is just a dress.</p>\n<p>Velvet raises this above the standard polyester fairytale sets in both feel and photographs. The red is deep rather than bright, which suits the story being referenced.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Material: velvet</li>\n<li>Includes: full set with shawl</li>\n<li>Style: Little Red Riding Hood</li>\n<li>Color: red</li>\n<li>Sizing: one size, recommended 40-60 kg</li>\n</ul>\n<p>One size for 40-60 kg. Add a basket from a corner shop and the costume is canonical.</p>\n",
